  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Completed job → QuickBooks Online invoice\nWhen a job, order or project is marked complete in another system, this creates the QuickBooks invoice once. It checks the invoice number first, matches the customer by email or name (or creates them), can email the invoice, and posts every result and failure to Slack.\n\n**You need:** n8n · a QuickBooks Online company and an Intuit developer app (OAuth2) · a Slack incoming webhook\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create a **QuickBooks Online OAuth2 API** credential and select it on the five QuickBooks steps.\n2. Fill in **Config**: `realm_id`, `default_item_id`, Slack URL. Keep `qbo_base_url` on the sandbox to start.\n3. Set the `field_*` names in **Config** to match your system's payload.\n4. Click **Test workflow** to send the sample job to your sandbox company.\n5. Point your system's webhook at **Job completed**, then switch `qbo_base_url` to `https://quickbooks.api.intuit.com`.\n\nNo credentials are included. Guide: pushbuild.com/guides/quickbooks-automation.html",
    "height": 1120,
    "width": 780,
    "color": 7
   },
   "id": "ed0f9a89-16fe-5aed-aa8f-250867f3c816",
   "name": "Note 1",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -860,
    -420
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "### 1 · Receive and map\nThe webhook, or **Test with sample data**, feeds **Map job**, which reads your payload using the `field_*` names in Config and checks it. A job with no id, no customer or a bad line goes to the alert instead.",
    "height": 720,
    "width": 1040,
    "color": 5
   },
   "id": "8dbb8096-dd9d-5ccf-a04c-c8700c55ceca",
   "name": "Note 2",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -80,
    -220
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "### 2 · Never invoice twice\nThe invoice number is the job id plus `invoice_prefix`. If QuickBooks already has it, Slack is told and nothing is created, so a re-sent webhook or a re-run is safe.",
    "height": 520,
    "width": 520,
    "color": 4
   },
   "id": "8102e850-d2d8-5ae2-bb58-7a2b664a2999",
   "name": "Note 3",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    960,
    -220
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "### 3 · Customer\nMatched by email when there is one, otherwise by display name; created if new.",
    "height": 520,
    "width": 780,
    "color": 6
   },
   "id": "a22273f1-2afc-53c9-9c24-181fa930bc24",
